      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The sum of the first \\(n\\) positive integers is \\(\\frac{n(n+1)}{2}.\\) Dividing by \\(n\\) gives the mean \\[ \\frac{n+1}{2}. \\]\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is E.",
